      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lagarto. A chama na cauda de Charmander revela a força de sua energia vital. Quando ele está fraco, ela também queima com pouca intensidade. Quando está saudável, arde vigorosamente e não se apaga nem mesmo se ficar um pouco molhada.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Charmander pode evoluir para Charmeleon no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Ember</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Dragon Breath, Smokescreen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Dragon Rage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Fire Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Flame Burst</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Flamethrower</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Flare Blitz</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Fire Spin, Inferno</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Attract, Beat Up, Body Slam, Breaking Swipe, Brick Break, Confide, Crunch, Dig, Double Team, Dragon Claw, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Echoed Voice, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fire Blast, Fire Fang, Fire Pledge, Fire Punch, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Metal Claw, Outrage, Overheat, Protect, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Scary Face, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Weather Ball, Will-O-Wisp, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Air Cutter, Ancient Power, Beat Up, Belly Drum, Bite, Counter, Crunch, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Rush, Dragon Tail, Flare Blitz, Focus Punch, Iron Tail, Metal Claw, Outrage, Wing Attack</p>",
